s.\\n- 2026-09-23 hyp-20260923-002-r3s1 (regression, -12.70%): A two-entry IF prefetch queue saved roughly 3% of CoreMark cycles, but its FIFO-head/live-bus bypass and queue control coincided with Fmax falling from 162.6 to 137.2 MHz, so fetch-side timing outweighed the hidden imem stalls.\\n- 2026-09-23 hyp-20260923-003-r3s2 (regression, -3.64%): A 32-en\n…[99088 of 102160 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:7ea117c5b1dc7d3e]…\nng load-use and dmem/divider holds.\\\"}, {\\\"file\\\": \\\"test/test_pipeline.py\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Check first-visit fill, warm taken loops, untaken exits, JAL, changed branch words, bus stalls, wrong-path side effects, and RVFI order/PC continuity.\\\"}], \\\"outcome\\\": \\\"regression\\\", \\\"fitness\\\": 252.03, \\\"delta_pct\\\": -38.31, \\\"vs_baseline\\\": -10.89, \\\"fmax_mhz\\\": 107.4, \\\"ipc_coremark\\\": 2e-06, \\\"cycles\\\": 4261396, \\\"iterations\\\": 10, \\\"lut4\\\": 5809, \\\"ff\\\": 2531, \\\"seeds\\\": [109.77, 107.4, 105.97], \\\"formal_passed\\\": true, \\\"cosim_passed\\\": true, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"implementation_notes\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"timestamp\\\": \\\"2026-09-23T18:17:26.040448Z\\\", \\\"slot\\\": 2, \\\"round_id\\\": 8, \\\"lesson\\\": \\\"- 2026-09-23 hyp-20260923-003-r8s2 (regression, -38.31%): Even replay after a resolved branch can lose fitness when EX-qualified cached-instruction and successor muxes feed IF/ID in the same cycle; roughly 5% fewer CoreMark cycles could not offset Fmax falling from 183.52 to 107.4 MHz.\\\"}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
