'h1fc, and capture nine-bit fit and carry metadata without gating the speculative PC mux on either check.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Apply the existing resolved-outcome and trap recovery to the widened same-block prediction metadata; update the correctness condition and comments for signed nine-bit offsets and 512-byte blocks.\"\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: \"Check taken backward branches newly covered by the nine-bit window, 256-byte and 512-byte boundaries, untaken and misaligned guesses, longer negative offsets, bus stalls, and exact RVFI PC and retirement order.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
